    "anchor": "tactical-missions-3",
    "summary": "If you use Tactical Missions, your Secondary Mission deck is shuffled and kept face-down. Then:\n\n- As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts, draw 2 Secondary Missions face-up; they become your active missions.\n- Once per battle, as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, you can pay 1 CP to swap 1 active Secondary Mission card for a newly drawn one.",
